title: '? Bury your queues, challenge yourself to escape*.'
pid: 78b925d8-33d1-4ebb-b47b-4edb154bb8da
body: |2-
  \* where escape = find your way back

  An unsorted bucket at the top of the queue
  dispels the danger of not finding your way back,
  but maybe increases the risk of being stuck there
  beyond what simple insertion (at the top, bc it's a queue)
  would do.
